      "id": "899dd43d-1a68-4cd3-ba91-71ace0e8c65d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "definitions of the words ‘game’, ‘videogame’, and ‘play’"
    },
    {
      "id": "7bed784b-d345-4fa3-b102-20d407c25578",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<strong>[UNDER CONSTRUCTION—many missing]</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea30bebe-03a3-413a-ba92-00ac9a0034df",
